  "bodyText": "Skip to content\nHeritage\nMen\nWomen\nAccessories\nTotal items in cart: 0\n\nHigh-quality textiles, transformed into heirloom-quality garments.\n\nShop Men\n\nShop Men\n\nShop Women\n\nShop Women\n\nLatest\n\nLatest\n\nAccessories\n\nThe Wool Blanket\n\nProduced in Canada using post-consumer recycled wool, we've selected a thick, sturdy weave that offers impressive warmth and water resistance. Generously sized for outdoor gatherings, camping excursions, or cozy nights under the open sky, the blanket effortlessly repels dirt and is machine washable when needed.\n\nShop now\nExplore the collection\nOur bestsellers\n\nAccessories\n\nThe Cozy Beanie\n\nDependable and cozy, this is an essential item for every season. Designed for year-round comfort and breathability, this popular piece keeps you warm in chilly conditions and regulated in those shoulder-season adventures. Versatility, performance and style in one practical package.\n\nShop now\nExplore the collection\n\nAbout us\n\nOur passion is sustainable, natural textiles. We create garments that can be enjoyed for generations to come.\n\nShop\nBestsellers\nMen\nWomen\nAccessories\nSupport\nFAQ\nContact\nFit guide\nGarment care\nOur story\nAbout us\nField notes\n© 2026 Heritage, Powered by Shopify"
